  "title": "Pr Suspected Hacker Arrested",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "Security measures to protect the ETH network from further attacks were introduced without delay. Thanks to effective cooperation between the cybercrime unit (CYC) and the ETH Zurich IT service, it was possible to apprehend the suspected hacker quickly. The suspect is an ETH student. ETH Zurich is now analysing the situation and enacting a reconstruction of the unauthorised action. They will then use their findings to identify and implement the necessary measures.\n\nETH Zurich Media Relations Phone: +41 44 632 41 41"
    }
  ],
